WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.775
A source review becomes more useful when we quantify
the problems How many

00:00:05.801 --> 00:00:12.589
values are missing How many fail a validation rule
How

00:00:12.602 --> 00:00:18.502
many duplicate groups appear after normalization Are
unusual values

00:00:18.529 --> 00:00:24.579
rare but plausible or clearly impossible Profiling
gives you a baseline

00:00:24.593 --> 00:00:28.185
and helps you measure whether a cleaning step
actually improves the dataset
